  "patthana10.8:0.3": "1-69-82. Kusalattika-upādānādidukāni ",
  "patthana10.8:1.1": "Nakusalaṃ noupādānaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca…. ",
  "patthana10.8:2.1": "Nakusalaṃ nanoupādānaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca…. ",
  "patthana10.8:3.1": "Nakusalaṃ nokilesaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca…. ",
  "patthana10.8:4.1": "Nakusalaṃ nanokilesaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca…. "
}
